WEBVTT

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:14.880
What...

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:16.370
What the hell is going on?!

00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:32.170
A Savage.

00:00:59.550 --> 00:01:00.380
D...

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:03.790
Don't!

00:01:20.830 --> 00:01:22.520
<i>Yet another dream about that day...</i>

00:01:26.150 --> 00:01:28.820
<i>Who was that girl?</i>

00:01:39.920 --> 00:01:43.230
<i>So that's the academy city-ship, </i>Little Garden<i>...</i>

00:01:44.630 --> 00:01:47.690
<i>My home from now on.</i>

00:03:20.630 --> 00:03:26.760
<b>Little Garden</b>

00:03:29.240 --> 00:03:31.640
This place is bigger than I thought.

00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:36.730
<b>We Cordially Welcome You</b>

00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:36.730
<b>Kisaragi Hayato-kun</b>

00:03:38.180 --> 00:03:42.180
Kisaragi-kun! Yes, you, with the highest
Hundred compatibility score of all time!

00:03:42.180 --> 00:03:43.800
Kisaragi Hayato-kun!

00:03:43.800 --> 00:03:45.720
Where are you?

00:03:45.720 --> 00:03:48.750
Holler if you can hear us!

00:03:50.050 --> 00:03:51.760
That's weird.

00:03:51.760 --> 00:03:55.550
Maybe he's on a later flight.

00:04:01.770 --> 00:04:03.270
I guess this is it.

00:04:05.160 --> 00:04:08.630
Um, is this where the entrance ceremony will be held?

00:04:08.630 --> 00:04:10.280
Yeah, it is.

00:04:10.280 --> 00:04:11.750
Wait!

00:04:11.750 --> 00:04:14.560
Are you Kisaragi Hayato?!

00:04:14.940 --> 00:04:15.480
What?

00:04:15.930 --> 00:04:18.100
So you're the one with the all-time record?

00:04:18.100 --> 00:04:19.570
Is it really him?!

00:04:19.570 --> 00:04:21.430
He looks completely normal.

00:04:21.430 --> 00:04:22.400
Give me your autograph!

00:04:28.710 --> 00:04:30.040
Hayato!

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:36.030
I couldn't wait to see you, Hayato!

00:04:35.070 --> 00:04:36.330
Ow, ow, ow...

00:04:37.960 --> 00:04:39.960
What are you doing?

00:04:40.250 --> 00:04:41.640
My name is Emile.

00:04:41.920 --> 00:04:43.550
Emile Crossfode.

00:04:43.820 --> 00:04:46.820
I'm also a new student here 
at the <i>Little Garden.</i>

00:04:47.170 --> 00:04:47.980
Let's get along, 'kay?

00:04:51.390 --> 00:04:53.080
S-Sure.

00:04:54.090 --> 00:04:55.600
I'm sorry, Hayato.

00:04:55.600 --> 00:04:57.710
I shouldn't have yelled out like that.

00:04:57.710 --> 00:04:59.100
That's right, Reitia.

00:04:59.100 --> 00:05:00.300
Apologize.

00:05:01.190 --> 00:05:02.220
Fritz!

00:05:02.220 --> 00:05:04.710
I told you to stop treating me like a kid.

00:05:04.710 --> 00:05:07.840
It's your fault for having your head
at such a perfect height.

00:05:09.460 --> 00:05:11.970
They've been friends since they were kids.

00:05:12.310 --> 00:05:14.280
They're really close, huh?

00:05:14.700 --> 00:05:16.290
Y-Yeah.

00:05:16.840 --> 00:05:20.610
You guys are pretty close yourself,
even though you just met.

00:05:21.120 --> 00:05:24.260
Yes. It's almost like you're not both guys.

00:05:25.240 --> 00:05:27.020
Really?

00:05:27.620 --> 00:05:29.260
What should we do, Hayato?

00:05:32.310 --> 00:05:35.770
I would like to welcome 
all the new students here.

00:05:36.170 --> 00:05:37.860
We're your MCs for today...

00:05:37.860 --> 00:05:39.950
Second-year military arts
student at the <i>Little Garden</i>

00:05:39.950 --> 00:05:42.820
and student council vice president, 
Erica Candle.

00:05:43.450 --> 00:05:45.990
Likewise. Liddy Steinberg.

00:05:46.670 --> 00:05:50.060
The captain of the <i>Little Garden,</i>

00:05:50.060 --> 00:05:53.990
as well as our president, Claire Harvey, 
will greet you.

00:05:57.190 --> 00:05:59.290
That's the student council president.

00:05:59.590 --> 00:06:00.430
Yeah.

00:06:00.880 --> 00:06:03.320
The queen, Claire Harvey.

00:06:10.100 --> 00:06:11.380
Sorry...

00:06:11.380 --> 00:06:13.580
Sorry we're late!

00:06:14.720 --> 00:06:15.780
<i>Those two...</i>

00:06:16.480 --> 00:06:19.020
Late for the entrance ceremony,
right off the bat?

00:06:19.020 --> 00:06:20.830
You two sure have some nerve.

00:06:20.830 --> 00:06:22.310
W-We're sorry!

00:06:22.310 --> 00:06:25.360
We had gone to the airport 
to pick up Kisaragi-kun.

00:06:25.690 --> 00:06:28.520
But we couldn't find him, and then...

00:06:28.520 --> 00:06:29.360
Enough excuses!

00:06:30.820 --> 00:06:33.960
Kisaragi Hayato has been 
right there this whole time.

00:06:34.490 --> 00:06:34.910
Huh?

00:06:37.280 --> 00:06:40.090
Noa Sheldon. Liu Xuemei.

00:06:40.460 --> 00:06:45.500
There is no place in the <i>Little Garden</i>
for those who cannot follow the rules.

00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:48.670
Collect your things and leave.

00:06:54.520 --> 00:06:56.340
I... uh....

00:06:56.340 --> 00:06:58.170
I think you're being kind of harsh here!

00:06:58.170 --> 00:06:59.440
E-Emile?

00:07:01.410 --> 00:07:03.600
Student council president or not,

00:07:03.600 --> 00:07:05.650
you can't just kick them out
for making one mistake.

00:07:05.650 --> 00:07:06.940
That's awful!

00:07:06.940 --> 00:07:07.330
Hey!

00:07:07.330 --> 00:07:08.810
Don't stop me, Hayato!

00:07:09.130 --> 00:07:12.350
I can't stand people who 
abuse their power like that.

00:07:12.350 --> 00:07:13.070
Yeah, but...

00:07:13.380 --> 00:07:15.580
You two are in no position to speak here.

00:07:15.900 --> 00:07:17.430
W-We're sorry.

00:07:18.500 --> 00:07:23.210
I-It's just that... I don't really think
they should be expelled just like that.

00:07:24.550 --> 00:07:26.040
Kisaragi Hayato.

00:07:28.050 --> 00:07:31.410
No, I will say this to everyone here.

00:07:31.710 --> 00:07:34.840
You are not just students.

00:07:34.840 --> 00:07:39.310
You are fledgling Slayers that will 
risk their lives to fight the Savages.

00:07:39.310 --> 00:07:44.000
On the battlefield,
 a single mistake can prove fatal

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:46.740
and destroy an entire squadron.

00:07:46.740 --> 00:07:49.080
It is not a matter of frequency.

00:07:49.080 --> 00:07:51.280
Failure to follow orders will lead to death.

00:07:51.670 --> 00:07:54.900
But there are times when 
orders can prove incorrect!

00:07:54.900 --> 00:07:57.830
That's enough, Emile Crossfode.

00:07:57.830 --> 00:08:01.290
Claire-sama's orders are absolute. She is
the queen of our military arts department.

00:08:01.290 --> 00:08:03.130
"Queen," my foot!

00:08:03.130 --> 00:08:06.790
Hayato has a higher
Hundred compatibility score.

00:08:06.790 --> 00:08:07.640
H-Hey!

00:08:07.640 --> 00:08:10.490
Emile Crossfode, if you try 
to demean her any further,

00:08:10.490 --> 00:08:11.900
you'll be expelled, as well!

00:08:11.900 --> 00:08:12.980
Bring it on!

00:08:12.980 --> 00:08:13.850
Just you try—

00:08:13.150 --> 00:08:14.180
Hey!

00:08:15.770 --> 00:08:16.870
Very well.

00:08:17.780 --> 00:08:23.810
As you wish, you will be expelled 
along with the previous two.

00:08:25.730 --> 00:08:27.680
Hey, stop going crazy!

00:08:27.920 --> 00:08:29.440
Kisaragi Hayato.

00:08:29.440 --> 00:08:30.660
Y-Yes!

00:08:31.450 --> 00:08:34.450
Do you object to their expulsion?

00:08:35.800 --> 00:08:36.950
Um...

00:08:37.310 --> 00:08:38.450
Do you?

00:08:39.740 --> 00:08:40.860
I...

00:08:44.700 --> 00:08:45.540
I do!

00:08:46.740 --> 00:08:47.460
Wha—

00:08:47.460 --> 00:08:48.710
Dude!

00:08:52.730 --> 00:08:56.520
The two girls were late because 
they were looking for me,

00:08:56.820 --> 00:08:58.840
and if that hadn't happened, 
Emile wouldn't have...

00:08:59.550 --> 00:09:00.690
Hayato...

00:09:00.690 --> 00:09:03.890
So I know I'm in no position to say this,

00:09:04.500 --> 00:09:06.560
but I ask that you please be lenient.

00:09:06.920 --> 00:09:09.770
Kisaragi Hayato, know your place!

00:09:09.770 --> 00:09:10.940
Very well.

00:09:11.600 --> 00:09:12.540
President!

00:09:16.150 --> 00:09:17.740
How about this, then?

00:09:20.450 --> 00:09:21.870
Kisaragi Hayato.

00:09:22.430 --> 00:09:24.370
I, Claire Harvey,

00:09:24.780 --> 00:09:27.370
challenge you to a duel.

00:09:30.610 --> 00:09:33.750
If you beat me, I will 
reverse their expulsion.

00:09:33.750 --> 00:09:35.810
We'll do this tomorrow afternoon.

00:09:35.810 --> 00:09:38.130
The place will be the main colosseum.

00:09:38.390 --> 00:09:40.420
H-Hold on a second. I still—

00:09:40.420 --> 00:09:41.630
You're on!

00:09:41.630 --> 00:09:42.990
Who asked you to decide?!

00:09:42.990 --> 00:09:44.200
Let's do it, Hayato!

00:09:44.200 --> 00:09:44.890
Huh?

00:09:45.310 --> 00:09:47.390
You can definitely beat her!

00:09:50.250 --> 00:09:51.920
Uh... Um...

00:09:51.920 --> 00:09:53.080
Hold on...

00:09:53.620 --> 00:09:54.820
What?

00:09:56.660 --> 00:09:58.160
What were you thinking?

00:09:59.060 --> 00:10:01.320
You can't just accept a duel like that.

00:10:01.320 --> 00:10:04.990
I'm going up against the queen,
the strongest person in the <i>Little Garden.</i>

00:10:04.990 --> 00:10:06.820
You'll be fine, Hayato.

00:10:06.820 --> 00:10:08.310
I'm sure you can win.

00:10:09.940 --> 00:10:11.590
What are you even basing that on?

00:10:12.050 --> 00:10:13.850
It'll be fine.

00:10:14.750 --> 00:10:15.260
Come on.

00:10:15.260 --> 00:10:15.930
Oh.

00:10:17.850 --> 00:10:20.100
I'll introduce you to my good friend.

00:10:20.100 --> 00:10:21.100
Good friend?

00:10:21.700 --> 00:10:24.690
The main technologist on the <i>Little Garden,</i>

00:10:24.690 --> 00:10:26.930
the chief researcher of the Hundred.

00:10:31.080 --> 00:10:33.440
So you're Kisaragi Hayato-kun.

00:10:34.170 --> 00:10:36.540
My name is Charlotte Dimandius.

00:10:36.940 --> 00:10:38.450
Call me Char.

00:10:38.750 --> 00:10:40.180
S-Sure.

00:10:40.750 --> 00:10:43.050
N-Nice to meet you.

00:10:43.050 --> 00:10:43.600
Huh?

00:10:43.600 --> 00:10:44.540
Sniff sniff sniff.

00:10:44.620 --> 00:10:45.590
Sniff sniff sniff.

00:10:45.590 --> 00:10:46.600
What is it?

00:10:48.220 --> 00:10:50.650
You're from the Empire of Yamato,

00:10:50.650 --> 00:10:53.170
but you don't smell like soy sauce.

00:10:53.590 --> 00:10:56.090
We normally don't...

00:10:58.310 --> 00:11:00.800
You might think she's pretty weird,

00:11:00.800 --> 00:11:03.930
but she's actually my talented assistant.

00:11:03.930 --> 00:11:06.100
Nice to meet you. I'm Meimei.

00:11:06.490 --> 00:11:07.600
Nice to meet you.

00:11:07.600 --> 00:11:11.600
And Char over here is smart enough 
to be called a child prodigy.

00:11:11.600 --> 00:11:12.600
Really?

00:11:13.000 --> 00:11:15.280
Are you trying to insult me?

00:11:15.280 --> 00:11:18.610
I'm actually old enough to get married, you know?

00:11:18.610 --> 00:11:19.950
Emil—

00:11:20.240 --> 00:11:24.220
Char, my name is Emile.

00:11:24.220 --> 00:11:26.510
Did you forget?

00:11:26.510 --> 00:11:30.260
Jorry aboud dat, Emile.

00:11:31.480 --> 00:11:31.960
Hmm?

00:11:32.230 --> 00:11:34.500
But I was surprised.

00:11:34.880 --> 00:11:37.940
A guy who's never used Hundred before

00:11:37.940 --> 00:11:40.930
is going to duel with Claire Harvey.

00:11:40.930 --> 00:11:42.680
You sure get your news fast.

00:11:43.220 --> 00:11:45.220
LiZA told me.

00:11:45.580 --> 00:11:46.600
LiZA?

00:11:47.200 --> 00:11:50.400
This autonomous computer that controls

00:11:50.400 --> 00:11:52.100
everything in the <i>Little Garden.</i>

00:11:53.180 --> 00:11:55.590
She can also express herself
and communicate with people.

00:11:55.990 --> 00:11:58.310
So this is LiZA?

00:11:58.840 --> 00:12:00.490
Exactly.

00:12:04.660 --> 00:12:08.040
This is your Hundred.

00:12:08.650 --> 00:12:11.000
I should explain before I give this to you.

00:12:11.780 --> 00:12:17.370
The Hundred are the only effective weapons
against the Savage lifeforms.

00:12:18.070 --> 00:12:23.840
However, only humans which respond 
to variable stones can use them.

00:12:26.230 --> 00:12:29.470
We call them Slayers.

00:12:30.290 --> 00:12:34.910
The Hundred change into a ton of forms
based on who uses them.

00:12:35.480 --> 00:12:39.570
That is where the Century Armaments,
or Hundred, get their name from.

00:12:40.920 --> 00:12:43.650
Claire Harvey uses this.

00:12:43.650 --> 00:12:46.180
Floating cannons that she can control at will.

00:12:51.220 --> 00:12:53.600
A dragoon type.

00:12:54.660 --> 00:12:56.750
She's strong, unsurprisingly.

00:12:57.140 --> 00:13:00.810
The Hundred take different forms 
and vary in their ways of fighting.

00:13:02.560 --> 00:13:05.510
But there's only one ultimate goal:

00:13:08.410 --> 00:13:10.890
to protect humanity.

00:13:12.530 --> 00:13:16.380
Hayato-kun, when you take 
hold of your Hundred,

00:13:16.380 --> 00:13:18.350
you will be entrusted with 
that responsibility.

00:13:19.330 --> 00:13:20.900
Are you ready?

00:13:25.760 --> 00:13:26.470
Yes.

00:13:27.280 --> 00:13:28.910
Good response.

00:13:35.150 --> 00:13:37.880
<i>This is my Hundred.</i>

00:13:37.880 --> 00:13:40.290
I got an area for you to practice.

00:13:40.600 --> 00:13:44.210
Change into your variable suit 
and use it freely.

00:13:44.730 --> 00:13:46.900
So this is a variable suit.

00:13:47.380 --> 00:13:49.610
It's a pretty tight fit.

00:13:50.220 --> 00:13:51.460
Yeah.

00:13:51.460 --> 00:13:55.160
This suit also takes a different form, 
depending on the person...

00:13:56.490 --> 00:13:58.610
What are you staring at?

00:13:59.470 --> 00:14:02.040
We're both guys. Why are you 
getting all embarrassed?

00:14:02.350 --> 00:14:05.270
Just get your Hundred out already.

00:14:05.270 --> 00:14:06.440
S-Sure.

00:14:07.550 --> 00:14:11.400
Take hold of your Hundred and strongly 
will it to become a weapon.

00:14:11.780 --> 00:14:15.400
Saying "Hundred On" will release it.

00:14:15.400 --> 00:14:16.510
Got it.

00:14:16.510 --> 00:14:18.290
Now let's give it a try.

00:14:18.290 --> 00:14:18.960
Sure.

00:14:33.970 --> 00:14:35.500
Hundred On.

00:15:01.560 --> 00:15:03.340
<i>Good job, Hayato-kun.</i>

00:15:04.570 --> 00:15:07.620
<i>That's your Hundred, Flying Swallow.</i>

00:15:07.620 --> 00:15:09.750
<i>It's a chevalier type.</i>

00:15:13.180 --> 00:15:14.150
Flying Swallow.

00:15:14.710 --> 00:15:16.350
My Hundred.

00:15:16.580 --> 00:15:20.180
I knew your Hundred would be cool!

00:15:20.180 --> 00:15:21.600
All right. Me, too!

00:15:21.600 --> 00:15:22.350
Emile,

00:15:22.890 --> 00:15:26.020
you already have your Hundred?

00:15:26.020 --> 00:15:26.860
Yeah.

00:15:27.360 --> 00:15:29.000
Some stuff happened.

00:15:31.200 --> 00:15:32.920
Hundred On.

00:15:53.330 --> 00:15:56.390
What's that Hundred?

00:15:56.890 --> 00:15:58.750
This is the Arms Shroud.

00:15:58.750 --> 00:16:01.890
My innocence type is a bit special.

00:16:02.140 --> 00:16:03.770
Innocence type?

00:16:04.330 --> 00:16:06.650
In any event, the duel is tomorrow.

00:16:06.650 --> 00:16:08.030
We don't have time.

00:16:08.400 --> 00:16:10.460
So we're going to have a trial by fire.

00:16:12.050 --> 00:16:13.490
Fire.

00:16:23.140 --> 00:16:25.020
That's pretty impressive, Hayato!

00:16:25.020 --> 00:16:27.560
You're already able to put up 
an energy barrier!

00:16:27.560 --> 00:16:29.740
I wasn't even...

00:16:30.160 --> 00:16:31.660
Wait, Emile!

00:16:31.660 --> 00:16:33.630
Who just attacks a person 
out of nowhere like that?!

00:16:33.870 --> 00:16:35.940
The student council president
 won't go easy on you!

00:16:36.260 --> 00:16:37.700
Y-You moron!

00:16:41.640 --> 00:16:42.430
Huh?

00:16:47.470 --> 00:16:49.170
Ow...

00:16:49.420 --> 00:16:51.570
Awesome! That was awesome, Hayato!

00:16:51.890 --> 00:16:54.350
You can win! There's no question!

00:16:54.350 --> 00:16:56.310
Y-Yeah, right!

00:16:56.310 --> 00:16:58.390
I came up with a plan.

00:16:58.390 --> 00:16:59.330
Plan?

00:17:01.050 --> 00:17:02.830
As such,

00:17:02.830 --> 00:17:05.290
I'm going to ride you hard!

00:17:05.590 --> 00:17:07.710
W-Wait!

00:17:12.680 --> 00:17:14.750
Good job hanging in there, Hayato.

00:17:14.750 --> 00:17:17.390
Now you'll definitely win tomorrow's duel.

00:17:17.650 --> 00:17:19.620
I'm not sure it'll go so well.

00:17:20.670 --> 00:17:21.320
Huh?

00:17:22.550 --> 00:17:24.520
Shoot. It's my sister.

00:17:24.520 --> 00:17:26.520
<b>Karen</b>

00:17:26.860 --> 00:17:31.300
I forgot I'd promised to go to the hospital
right after the entrance ceremony.

00:17:31.700 --> 00:17:33.020
Hospital?

00:17:33.020 --> 00:17:35.300
Is your sister hospitalized?

00:17:35.300 --> 00:17:38.160
Yeah. She's not exactly healthy.

00:17:40.000 --> 00:17:44.970
I came to the <i>Little Garden</i> on the condition
that she'd get cutting-edge medical care.

00:17:45.990 --> 00:17:48.870
Sorry, Emile. Head back to the dorm on your own.

00:17:48.870 --> 00:17:50.920
S-Sure.

00:17:53.430 --> 00:17:54.420
I'm sorry, Karen!

00:17:54.670 --> 00:17:56.300
My bad!

00:17:58.970 --> 00:18:02.260
Hey, could you forgive me already?

00:18:02.900 --> 00:18:04.140
In that case...

00:18:09.330 --> 00:18:10.970
What am I gonna do with you?

00:18:18.290 --> 00:18:19.700
I forgive you.

00:18:21.720 --> 00:18:22.630
Oh, yeah.

00:18:22.630 --> 00:18:24.720
How was the entrance ceremony?

00:18:25.130 --> 00:18:28.020
W-Well, you see...

00:18:28.020 --> 00:18:30.320
A lot happened.

00:18:31.450 --> 00:18:32.360
Come in.

00:18:33.680 --> 00:18:34.420
Torpedoes!

00:18:35.920 --> 00:18:38.860
Sorry to interrupt, Karen-chan,

00:18:38.860 --> 00:18:41.430
but it's almost the end of visiting hours.

00:18:41.690 --> 00:18:43.530
What? Already?

00:18:43.530 --> 00:18:45.430
I... I'm sorry.

00:18:45.810 --> 00:18:47.040
I'll be leaving now.

00:18:47.040 --> 00:18:48.250
You perv.

00:18:48.250 --> 00:18:48.860
What?

00:18:48.860 --> 00:18:51.160
You're getting all flustered
looking at Miharu's boobs.

00:18:51.160 --> 00:18:53.270
S-Stupid! I'm not...

00:18:57.930 --> 00:19:00.030
It got pretty late.

00:19:03.540 --> 00:19:05.360
The lights are on?

00:19:07.240 --> 00:19:07.790
Huh?

00:19:11.910 --> 00:19:12.880
Emile?

00:19:14.910 --> 00:19:17.110
Hayato...

00:19:17.920 --> 00:19:19.230
Get out!

00:19:19.230 --> 00:19:20.550
W-Wait!

00:19:20.550 --> 00:19:21.930
You moron! Don't—

00:19:33.600 --> 00:19:35.620
Oh, are you up, Hayato?

00:19:37.560 --> 00:19:38.480
Emile...

00:19:41.320 --> 00:19:42.180
Ow!

00:19:42.860 --> 00:19:45.130
Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow...

00:19:45.130 --> 00:19:47.200
What was that for?!

00:19:47.200 --> 00:19:49.990
It's your fault for getting up so suddenly.

00:19:49.990 --> 00:19:51.160
A-Are you stupid?

00:19:51.160 --> 00:19:54.500
I just panicked because I was resting my head on another guy's lap.

00:19:58.440 --> 00:20:01.010
This is all your fault to begin with.

00:20:01.010 --> 00:20:04.010
You just waltzed right in. 
That's why this happened.

00:20:04.260 --> 00:20:06.180
"Waltzed right in," you say?

00:20:06.180 --> 00:20:08.930
This is my room, you know?

00:20:09.580 --> 00:20:13.490
Wait. Why are you in my room, anyway?

00:20:14.350 --> 00:20:15.860
I didn't say?

00:20:16.550 --> 00:20:19.190
We're roommates.

00:20:19.520 --> 00:20:20.250
Huh?

00:20:21.580 --> 00:20:22.530
What?

00:20:22.860 --> 00:20:25.100
There you have it.

00:20:25.100 --> 00:20:27.280
Now take off your uniform.

00:20:27.280 --> 00:20:29.540
I'll sew your badge back on.

00:20:32.130 --> 00:20:33.280
Are you okay?

00:20:33.850 --> 00:20:35.670
I can do that myself.

00:20:35.670 --> 00:20:38.200
You have an important duel tomorrow.

00:20:38.200 --> 00:20:40.310
Just let me handle it—

00:20:40.310 --> 00:20:41.010
Ow.

00:20:41.420 --> 00:20:42.280
See.

00:20:44.720 --> 00:20:45.810
We need to take care of that now.

00:20:45.810 --> 00:20:46.050
Huh?

00:20:48.140 --> 00:20:49.820
H-Hayato.

00:20:50.120 --> 00:20:52.010
You can't just...

00:20:56.500 --> 00:20:57.480
Are you okay?

00:20:58.230 --> 00:21:00.020
Y-Yeah.

00:21:01.140 --> 00:21:03.930
It wasn't that big of a deal...

00:21:04.280 --> 00:21:05.360
It's just how I am.

00:21:05.870 --> 00:21:09.460
I got mixed up in a Savage 
attack a long time ago.

00:21:09.880 --> 00:21:11.390
Now, when I see someone get hurt,

00:21:12.760 --> 00:21:14.620
I just have to do something.

00:21:15.880 --> 00:21:16.970
Hayato...

00:21:18.720 --> 00:21:19.880
Thank you.

00:21:30.160 --> 00:21:32.310
Are you ready?

00:21:32.630 --> 00:21:34.810
As much as I can be.

00:21:35.700 --> 00:21:38.260
In that case, have at you.

00:21:39.170 --> 00:21:40.860
Hundred On.

00:21:53.000 --> 00:21:54.780
Hundred On.

00:22:07.230 --> 00:22:11.210
The duel between the queen, Claire Harvey,

00:22:11.210 --> 00:22:14.520
and the new student, 
Kisaragi Hayato, shall begin.

00:22:20.760 --> 00:22:22.440
Now, Kisaragi Hayato,

00:22:23.060 --> 00:22:25.620
show me how strong you are!

00:24:00.960 --> 00:24:05.870
<b>The Invincible Queen</b>
